      "text": "Medical Module\nGET /pets/:petId/medical-record\nGET /pets/:petId/medical-record/entries\nPOST /pets/:petId/medical-record/entries auto-creates medical_records row if missing\nPATCH /medical-entries/:entryId updates diagnosis, treatment, status, notes\nDELETE /medical-entries/:entryId removes one history entry",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
