      "text": "Explanation\nPK = primary key\nFK = foreign key\nunique = one-to-one or unique value\nCascade delete: deleting pet removes child pet images, medical records, vaccinations, and adoption requests\nUsers table is central for login, roles, staff, adopters, vets, reviewers, and message senders",
